        "are most important for understanding where recovery opportunities exist?"
    ),
    "intended_user": "A business user reviewing lost CRM deals for recovery planning.",
    "decision_supported": (
        "Use descriptive evidence from the available lost-deal records to identify "
        "where recovery attention may be concentrated."
    ),
    "predictive_status": {
        "status": "Rejected for current dataset",
        "reason": "Insufficient target definition, historical depth, sample size, and validation evidence."
    },

    "limitations": [
        "Only 20 synthetic records are available.",
        "The source does not establish a complete operational population.",
        "Currency is unspecified in the source data.",
        "Geographic coordinates are not available.",
